{"id":"138d8c34e0370a6b","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-modalized.md","title":"Modalized Formula","display":"df-modalized — Modalized Formula","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-modalized","aliases":["89-df-modalized"],"display":"df-modalized — Modalized Formula","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-modalized"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-modalized</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-modalized — Modalized Formula"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Modalized}(A,p)\">\\(\\mathrm{Modalized}(A,p)\\)</span> 是下述定义的二元模态化谓词，参数依次为模态公式与命题变元。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modalized}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Modalized}(A,p)\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\in\\bigcap\\left\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;(\\mathrm{Prop}\\setminus\\{p\\})\\cup\\{\\bot\\}\\subseteq X,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall B\\in X\\;(\\neg B\\in X),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall B,C\\in X\\;((B\\land C)\\in X),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;(\\Box B\\in X)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modalized}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Modalized}(A,p)\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\in\\bigcap\\left\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;(\\mathrm{Prop}\\setminus\\{p\\})\\cup\\{\\bot\\}\\subseteq X,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall B\\in X\\;(\\neg B\\in X),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall B,C\\in X\\;((B\\land C)\\in X),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;(\\Box B\\in X)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Modalized}(A, p)\">\\(\\mathrm{Modalized}(A, p)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>中modalized</li>\n<li>modalized条件：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>的每次出现都在某个<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box\">\\(\\Box\\)</span>的作用域内</li>\n<li>modalized公式在GL中必有显式不动点</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}$ (see [[89-df-modal-formula]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Modalized}(A,p)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modalized}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Modalized}(A,p)\\Longleftrightarrow\nA\\in\\bigcap\\left\\{X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\ \\middle|\\\n\\begin{aligned}\n&(\\mathrm{Prop}\\setminus\\{p\\})\\cup\\{\\bot\\}\\subseteq X,\\\\\n&\\forall B\\in X\\;(\\neg B\\in X),\\\\\n&\\forall B,C\\in X\\;((B\\land C)\\in X),\\\\\n&\\forall B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\;(\\Box B\\in X)\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Modalized}(A, p)","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box","display":false}],"bytes":1053,"backlinks":[{"id":"6d8c3016a32d17f8","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d8f6cb40eba269af","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Modalized}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\times\\mathrm{Prop}$ (see [[89-df-modalized]])."},{"id":"4c9feb1083d7b4dd","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"251691cede4cbc3e","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"16ae22435ebdf5f5","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c2347bd841306e40","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f1d156eef84de1db","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ad8a244f68941668","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-364","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-modalized]]"}],"outgoing":["56c1b5b75a32ca1d"]}